This PR includes the functionalities from the Previous PR: https://github.com/abcxyz/team-link/pull/88.

This PR also includes the cli refactor we discussed offline.

After the refactoring, the new command line will be:
```
tlctl sync run -m <your_mapping_file.textproto> -c <your_config_file.textproto>
```

The structure for the mapping file:
```
# mapping

group_mappings {
    mappings: [
        {
          # this team only has Qinhang
          google_groups: {
            group_id: "groups/xxxxxxx"
          }
          github: {
            # qh-org
            org_id: 111
            # test-everyone
            team_id: 222
          }
        }
      ]
}
user_mappings {
    mappings: [
        {
            source: "foo@bar.com"
            target: "github-user-id"
        }
    ]
}
```

Structure for config file.
```
# config
source_config {
    google_groups_config {}
}
target_config {
    github_config {
        enterprise_url: "https://github.com",
        static_auth {
            from_environment: "TEAM_LINK_GITHUB_TOKEN"
        }
    }
}
```

For test run result, the output is the same as the Previous PR: https://github.com/abcxyz/team-link/pull/88.

